@startuml
title Flujo realtime de notificaciones V3

actor Usuario
participant "Promesa/CNA Service" as Service
participant "WorkflowNotifier" as Notifier
participant "Laravel Notification" as Notification
database "notifications" as Db
participant "Broadcast channel\nprivate-App.Models.User.{id}" as Channel
participant "Laravel Reverb" as Reverb
participant "Laravel Echo" as Echo
participant "Campanita Topbar" as Bell

Usuario -> Service: Crea o resuelve Promesa/CNA
Service -> Notifier: Notificar workflow
Notifier -> Notification: database + broadcast
Notification -> Db: Guardar notificacion
Notification -> Channel: Broadcast payload
Channel -> Reverb: WebSocket
Reverb -> Echo: Evento realtime
Echo -> Bell: notification(payload)
Bell -> Bell: Actualizar contador
Bell -> Bell: Insertar item si panel abierto
Bell -> Usuario: Toast + sonido

note right of Bell
Si Reverb no esta activo,
la campanita sigue usando fetch:
/notificaciones
/notificaciones/unread-count
end note

@enduml
